  "scopeNote": {
    "en": "A single flat list of buyer-facing product classes (SD-0042) — no nested procurement channels. Scope (SD-0051): the catalogue focuses on traditional print (offset, flexo, digital) plus large-format technology. Pure merchandise (mugs, apparel, tote bags, phone cases, drinkware, pens, home & living) and 3-D products are out of scope. Each product carries a definition, altLabels, a Setup Model and a Configuration Envelope of supported options.",
    "nb": "Én flat liste med kjøper-rettede produktklasser (SD-0042) — ingen nøstede anskaffelseskanaler. Scope (SD-0051): katalogen fokuserer på tradisjonell trykk (offset, flexo, digital) pluss storformat-teknologi. Ren merch (krus, klær, totebager, mobildeksler, drikkeutstyr, penner, home & living) og 3D-produkter er utenfor scope. Hvert produkt har definisjon, altLabels, en Setup Model og en Configuration Envelope med støttede valg.",
    "de": "Eine einzige flache Liste käuferorientierter Produktklassen (SD-0042) — keine verschachtelten Beschaffungskanäle. Umfang (SD-0051): Fokus auf traditionellen Druck (Offset, Flexo, Digital) plus Großformat. Reine Merchandise- und 3-D-Produkte sind außerhalb des Umfangs.",
    "ja": "A single flat list of buyer-facing product classes (SD-0042) — no nested procurement channels. Scope (SD-0051): the catalogue focuses on traditional print (offset, flexo, digital) plus large-format technology. Pure merchandise (mugs, apparel, tote bags, phone cases, drinkware, pens, home & living) and 3-D products are out of scope. Each product carries a definition, altLabels, a Setup Model and a Configuration Envelope of supported options.",
    "es": "A single flat list of buyer-facing product classes (SD-0042) — no nested procurement channels. Scope (SD-0051): the catalogue focuses on traditional print (offset, flexo, digital) plus large-format technology. Pure merchandise (mugs, apparel, tote bags, phone cases, drinkware, pens, home & living) and 3-D products are out of scope. Each product carries a definition, altLabels, a Setup Model and a Configuration Envelope of supported options.",
    "zh-Hans": "A single flat list of buyer-facing product classes (SD-0042) — no nested procurement channels. Scope (SD-0051): the catalogue focuses on traditional print (offset, flexo, digital) plus large-format technology. Pure merchandise (mugs, apparel, tote bags, phone cases, drinkware, pens, home & living) and 3-D products are out of scope. Each product carries a definition, altLabels, a Setup Model and a Configuration Envelope of supported options.",
    "pt": "Uma única lista plana de classes de produto voltadas ao comprador (SD-0042) — sem canais de compra aninhados. Escopo (SD-0051): o catálogo concentra-se em impressão tradicional (offset, flexo, digital) mais tecnologia de grande formato. Brindes puros (canecas, vestuário, sacolas, capas de celular, canetas, casa e decoração) e produtos 3D estão fora do escopo. Cada produto traz definição, altLabels, um Modelo de Montagem e um Envelope de Configuração com as opções suportadas.",
    "hi": "खरीदार-उन्मुख उत्पाद वर्गों की एक ही सपाट सूची (SD-0042) — कोई नेस्टेड खरीद चैनल नहीं। दायरा (SD-0051): कैटलॉग पारंपरिक मुद्रण (ऑफसेट, फ्लेक्सो, डिजिटल) और लार्ज-फॉर्मेट तकनीक पर केंद्रित है। शुद्ध मर्चेंडाइज़ (मग, कपड़े, टोट बैग, फोन केस, पेन, होम एंड लिविंग) और 3-D उत्पाद दायरे से बाहर हैं। हर उत्पाद में परिभाषा, altLabels, एक सेटअप मॉडल और समर्थित विकल्पों का कॉन्फ़िगरेशन एन्वेलप होता है।"
  }
}
